insert into public.guides (product_id, category_id, slug, title, standfirst, blocks, start_here, meta_title, meta_description, author_name, status)
select p.id, c.id, $c$insights-will-we-stay-on-budget$c$, $c$Insights: will we stay on budget?$c$, $c$See whether the group is on pace for the whole-trip budget, play with the daily spend to see where the trip would land, and check your own pace against your daily budget.$c$, $c$[{"type":"callout","title":"The short version","text":"Set the trip's dates and a **Whole-trip budget (whole group)** in Trip settings, then open **Insights › Will we stay on budget?**. It shows where the trip is heading and what daily spend would land it on budget."},{"type":"heading","text":"What it needs"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":["**Trip dates**: a start and end date, under Trip settings › Details. Without them it only shows what the group has spent.","**Whole-trip budget (whole group)**: under Trip settings › Money. It's on Free and Pro, not guest accounts, so guests don't get the over/under answer.","**Daily budget (your share)**: optional, for the **Your own pace** card."]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"See [Daily and whole-trip budgets](/guides/zotikos/daily-and-whole-trip-budgets) for how to set these."},{"type":"heading","text":"The answer at the top"},{"type":"table","caption":"","header":["Where the trip is","What you see"],"rows":[["No dates yet","What's been spent, and “add trip dates to see the pace”."],["Before it starts","“Starts …” and how much is already paid ahead."],["During, first two days","“{amount} so far”. The pace shows after two full days."],["During, no budget","“{amount} a day” and where the trip ends near; set a whole-trip budget to compare."],["During, with a budget","“About … over” or “under”, or “Right on budget”, at the current pace."],["Finished","“The trip ended at …”, and how far over or under its budget."]]},{"type":"heading","text":"How the pace is worked out"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The pace is the group's average day-to-day spending over the full days so far (today isn't counted). It needs at least two full days. It only counts expenses dated to a single day: a stay or pass covering several days is left out of the pace and counted once, as paid, in the total. The projection is what's spent plus the pace for each day left."},{"type":"heading","text":"Everyone's spending, added up"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":["A chart of the group's running total, with the whole-trip budget line and a dotted projection.","During the trip, once the pace is known, the **From tomorrow, the group spends a day** slider: drag it to try a different daily spend and watch the projection and the chart's end point move. Chips below it jump to **Current pace** or **Lands on budget**.","“The trip ends near …” (“The trip ended at …” afterwards) with “right on budget” or how much over or under.","“Room to spend, a day” (or “To land on budget”) with “about … each”, which divides it by the number of travellers. If the budget is already used up, it says so."]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If part of the total is for days still to come, such as a hotel paid in advance, a note says how much (“… of it is for days still to come”)."},{"type":"heading","text":"Your own pace"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If the trip has a daily budget, this card shows **You average** (your share per full day), **Your daily budget**, and **Carried into today**: what you were under (or over) on earlier days (rollover is on by default). During the trip it ends with “Spend up to … a day for the … days left and you finish on your budget.”"},{"type":"faq","items":[{"q":"Why is there no over or under?","a":"The trip needs start and end dates and a whole-trip budget. Guests can't set a whole-trip budget; it's on Free and Pro."},{"q":"Why does it say the pace shows after two full days?","a":"A single day isn't enough to call a pace. Come back after the second day of the trip."},{"q":"Where is what I have left today?","a":"On the trip's **Overview**, in the “Today” budget section (it shows when the trip has a daily budget)."}]},{"type":"cta","title":"Land it on budget.","text":"","label":"Open Zotikos","url":"https://zotikosapp.midnightpoetry.studio/"}]$c$::jsonb, false, $c$Insights: will we stay on budget? | Zotikos$c$, $c$Read the Zotikos budget answer: the group's pace and projection, the From tomorrow slider, and your own pace with what's carried into today.$c$, 'Midnight Poetry Studio', 'published'
